#     prediction states HOW LONG the fade takes. Putting years into a field
#     documented as a 0-1 fraction is exactly the category error that stalled
#     this queue item once already, when a digital-intermediate recording film
#     was nearly filed as a camera negative to get at a field.
# ⚠ NOTHING ON THE RENDER PATH READS EITHER, and both are appended AFTER every
