#   * `PrintStock.mtf_f50_r/g/b`, `mtf_f50_bound`, `mtf_measured` (queue C36).
#     ⚠ THE POINT IS THE CENSORING, not the extra precision. H-1-2254's MTF
#     panel plots three records and TWO NEVER REACH 50 % response -- they stop
#     at 82.2 cycles/mm with green at 53.1 % and red at 50.6 %, while blue
#     crosses at 51.9. A single scalar cannot be right about that set, and the
#     stored estimate 72.0 was wrong in both directions at once. A 0.0 in the
