        # ⚠ CURVE TRACED 2026-09-22 from F-4043 (2007) p9, the D-76 small-tank
        # 20 C panel, which draws 6 / 8 / 11 minutes. THE TWO KODAK SHEETS
        # DISAGREE ABOUT THE TIME: F-4043's own table prints 7 1/2 minutes for
