    #
    # ⚠ THE MEASURED OFFSETS AND THE PRINTED EI LADDER AGREE, BUT NOT PERFECTLY,
    # AND THE DISAGREEMENT IS RECORDED RATHER THAN REMOVED. Predicted from the
