        # [T1] PRINTING-DENSITY MATRIX, DERIVED 2026-09-03 (schema v25) from
        # spectra already in this database -- no new source, no new estimate.
        #
        # THE DERIVATION, and it is the same arithmetic `dye_matrix_from_
